    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "\ud83d\udccb TLS Certificate Inventory",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "content": "<div style='padding:16px;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.9'>\n<div style='color:#7ee787;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:8px'>TLS Certificate Monitoring</div>\n<div style='color:#aaa'>\nThe <b style='color:#79c0ff'>nvis_cert_expiry_days</b> metric tracks certificate expiry across services.<br>\nTo add certificates, write to <code>/var/lib/node_exporter/textfile/nvis_certs.prom</code> on any node:<br>\n<pre style='background:#161b22;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;margin:8px 0;color:#c9d1d9'>\n# HELP nvis_cert_expiry_days Days until certificate expiry\n# TYPE nvis_cert_expiry_days gauge\nnvis_cert_expiry_days{service=\"my-service\",cluster=\"my-cluster\"} 90\n</pre>\nAlert thresholds: <span style='color:#f85149'>Critical &lt;7d</span> \u00b7 <span style='color:#d29922'>Warning &lt;30d</span> \u00b7 <span style='color:#7ee787'>OK \u226530d</span>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "mode": "html"
      }
    },
